<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia end-May palm oil stocks 711,841 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Malaysia end-May palm oil stocks 711,841 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's palm oil stocks rose 1.78 percent to 711,841 tonnes at end-May from 699,423 at end-April and compared with 715,249 at end-May 1996, the Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority (PORLA) said on Monday.</p>
</text>
